---
import '../styles/landing.css';
import FooterSignature from '../components/FooterSignature.astro';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Lander — Orbiter on PHP hosting</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Lander runs the Orbiter admin on ordinary PHP hosting: PHP 8.1+ and SQLite, no Node. Same SQL file (.pod), same Station interface, live API for your site." />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://orbiter.sh/lander/" />
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
  <script src="/search.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body id="top">
  <div class="nebula nebula-1" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <header class="ld-top">
    <a href="/" class="ld-logo">🪐 Orbiter</a>
    <div class="ld-links">
      <a href="/">Home</a><a href="/docs/">Docs</a><a href="/changelog/">Changelog</a><a href="/lander" aria-current="page">Lander</a>
      <button type="button" class="sp-trigger" data-search-open aria-label="Search the site (press /)">Search <kbd>/</kbd></button>
      <a href="https://github.com/aeon022/lander" class="ld-gh" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="main" class="ld">
    <section class="ld-hero">
      <span class="ld-badge">PHP 8.1+ · SQLite · MIT</span>
      <h1>Orbiter,<br /><span>on any web host.</span></h1>
      <p class="ld-sub">Orbiter stays in orbit. <strong>Lander</strong> sets down on ordinary shared hosting: the same admin, the same SQL file (<code>.pod</code>), no Node and no build server.</p>
      <div class="ld-cta">
        <a class="ld-btn" href="https://github.com/aeon022/lander" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get Lander on GitHub</a>
        <a class="ld-btn ld-ghost" href="/docs/lander">Read the docs →</a>
      </div>
      <figure class="ld-shot">
        <div class="ld-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>redaktion.example.at</span></div>
        <img src="/screenshots/lander-dashboard.webp" width="1600" height="1000" alt="The Lander admin in Station mode: dashboard with calendar, stats and dock" loading="eager" />
      </figure>
    </section>

    <section class="ld-sec">
      <h2>One SQL file, two runtimes</h2>
      <p class="ld-lead">Your content lives in a single SQL file (<code>.pod</code>). It is a plain SQLite database, <strong>only renamed</strong> to <code>.pod</code>: open it with any SQLite tool. Run it on Node with Orbiter or on PHP with Lander, and copy the file to move the whole site.</p>
      <div class="ld-flow">
        <div class="ld-node"><b>Orbiter</b><small>Node · Hono</small><em>VPS, local, desktop</em></div>
        <div class="ld-pod"><svg width="44" height="44" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5.5" rx="8" ry="3"/><path d="M4 5.5v6c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3v-6M4 11.5v6c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3v-6"/></svg><b>content.pod</b><small>SQL file · just renamed SQLite</small></div>
        <div class="ld-node ld-node-hl"><b>Lander</b><small>PHP · PDO SQLite</small><em>shared hosting</em></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ld-sec">
      <h2>Everything an editor needs</h2>
      <div class="ld-grid">
        <div><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M8 21h8M12 18v3"/></svg><h3>The real admin</h3><p>Station mode, themes, dock, editor and media library. Not a lookalike: the Orbiter interface, served as static files.</p></div>
        <div><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg><h3>Live API</h3><p><code>/api/public/&lt;collection&gt;</code> with CORS and a 60 s cache. Edits show on your site without a rebuild.</p></div>
        <div><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 3h9l4 4v14H6z"/><path d="M9 13l2 2 4-4"/></svg><h3>Markdown import</h3><p>Bring in <code>.md</code> files with frontmatter from the admin, or with <code>bin/lander import-md</code>.</p></div>
        <div><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><circle cx="9" cy="11" r="2"/><path d="M21 16l-5-5-8 8"/></svg><h3>Media as files</h3><p>Uploads go to a plain folder. File type is checked, PHP execution is blocked there.</p></div>
        <div><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l8 3v6c0 5-3.5 8-8 9-4.5-1-8-4-8-9V6z"/></svg><h3>Hardened</h3><p>Server-side validation, size limits, escaped output, admin-only meta writes. The same fixes as Orbiter 0.3.92+.</p></div>
        <div><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 7l8-4 8 4v10l-8 4-8-4z"/><path d="M4 7l8 4 8-4M12 11v10"/></svg><h3>Zero build</h3><p>Upload a folder, point the document root at <code>public/</code>. No Node, no composer, no build step.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ld-sec">
      <h2>Lander or Orbiter?</h2>
      <div class="ld-table">
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th></th><th>Orbiter</th><th>Lander</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>Runtime</td><td>Node (Hono)</td><td>PHP 8.1+ (PDO SQLite)</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Hosting</td><td>VPS, local, desktop app</td><td>Any PHP shared host</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Media</td><td>In the SQL file or S3</td><td>Files in a folder</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Admin, editor, import, inbox</td><td class="y">✓</td><td class="y">✓</td></tr>
            <tr><td>2FA, review workflow, webhooks, analytics, form builder</td><td class="y">✓</td><td class="n">not yet</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ld-sec">
      <h2>Live in four steps</h2>
      <ol class="ld-steps">
        <li><b>Upload</b><span>the folder; set the document root to <code>public/</code> (ideally its own subdomain).</span></li>
        <li><b>Configure</b><span><code>cp lander.config.example.php lander.config.php</code></span></li>
        <li><b>Permissions</b><span>make <code>data/</code> and <code>public/media/</code> writable.</span></li>
        <li><b>First user</b><span><code>php bin/lander user &lt;name&gt; admin</code></span></li>
      </ol>
      <pre class="ld-code"><span class="c">// in your Astro site</span>
const events = await fetch('https://redaktion.example.at/api/public/events')
  .then(r =&gt; r.json());</pre>
    </section>

    <section class="ld-end">
      <h2>Ready to land?</h2>
      <p>Lander is MIT licensed and in use on a first live site. It is young: expect rough edges and a growing feature list.</p>
      <div class="ld-cta" style="justify-content:center">
        <a class="ld-btn" href="https://github.com/aeon022/lander" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github.com/aeon022/lander</a>
        <a class="ld-btn ld-ghost" href="/docs/lander">Documentation →</a>
      </div>
      <p class="ld-support">Lander is free and stays free. If it saves you time, you can support its development.<br /><a class="ld-btn ld-coffee" href="https://buy.polar.sh/polar_cl_SFvmYDegcsKDv8O8ZylLlIiXzyNRM7Br9nBx942rj4Q" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">☕ Buy us a coffee</a></p>
    </section>
  </main>
  <FooterSignature />
</body>
</html>

<style is:global>
  .ld-top { position: relative; z-index: 3; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px 24px; }
  .ld-logo { color: #fff; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: .04em; }
  .ld-links { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 14px; }
  .ld-links a { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; }
  .ld-links a:hover, .ld-links a[aria-current] { color: var(--text); }
  .ld-links .ld-gh { border: 1px solid var(--border-hi); border-radius: 999px; padding: 5px 14px; color: var(--text); }
  .ld-links .sp-trigger { font: inherit; font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); background: transparent; border: 1px solid var(--border-hi); border-radius: 999px; padding: 4px 12px; cursor: pointer; }
  .ld { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px 40px; }
  .ld-hero { text-align: center; padding: 56px 0 24px; }
  .ld-badge { display: inline-block; font: 500 12px/1 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; letter-spacing: .08em; color: var(--accent); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 40%, transparent); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 10%, transparent); border-radius: 999px; padding: 8px 14px; }
  .ld h1 { font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 7vw, 5rem); line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -.03em; margin: 22px 0 18px; color: #fff; }
  .ld h1 span { background: linear-gradient(100deg, #b4a9ff, #8b7cf8 40%, #5eead4); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent; }
  .ld-sub { max-width: 620px; margin: 0 auto; font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--muted); }
  .ld-sub strong { color: var(--text); }
  .ld-cta { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; margin: 28px 0 0; }
  .ld-btn { padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-2); color: #fff; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; box-shadow: 0 0 32px rgba(139,124,248,.35); transition: box-shadow .2s, transform .2s; }
  .ld-btn:hover { box-shadow: 0 0 46px rgba(139,124,248,.6); transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .ld-ghost { background: transparent; color: var(--text); border: 1px solid var(--border-hi); box-shadow: none; }
  .ld-shot { margin: 56px auto 0; max-width: 980px; border: 1px solid var(--border-hi); border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden; background: var(--surface); box-shadow: 0 30px 90px rgba(0,0,0,.6), 0 0 120px rgba(139,124,248,.18); }
  .ld-bar { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 10px 14px; background: var(--surface-2); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .ld-bar i { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #2a2a50; }
  .ld-bar span { margin-left: 10px; font: 12px 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; color: var(--muted); }
  .ld-shot img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .ld-sec { padding: 84px 0 0; }
  .ld-sec h2, .ld-end h2 { font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3.4vw, 2.4rem); letter-spacing: -.02em; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 14px; color: #fff; }
  .ld-lead { max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto 36px; text-align: center; color: var(--muted); }
  .ld-flow { display: flex; align-items: stretch; justify-content: center; gap: 0; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .ld-node, .ld-pod { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 4px; min-width: 210px; padding: 24px 28px; border: 1px solid var(--border-hi); border-radius: 14px; background: var(--surface); }
  .ld-node b, .ld-pod b { font-size: 1.15rem; color: #fff; }
  .ld-node small, .ld-pod small { color: var(--muted); font: 12px 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; }
  .ld-node em { font-style: normal; font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 6px; }
  .ld-node-hl { border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 60%, transparent); box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(139,124,248,.2); }
  .ld-pod { color: var(--accent); min-width: 190px; margin: 0 -1px; border-style: dashed; background: transparent; }
  .ld-pod b { color: var(--text); }
  .ld-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-top: 36px; }
  .ld-grid > div { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px; background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--surface-2), var(--surface)); transition: border-color .2s, transform .2s; }
  .ld-grid > div:hover { border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, transparent); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .ld-grid svg { width: 26px; height: 26px; fill: none; stroke: var(--accent); stroke-width: 1.6; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .ld-grid h3 { margin: 14px 0 6px; font-size: 1.05rem; color: #fff; }
  .ld-grid p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: .94rem; }
  .ld-table { margin-top: 32px; border: 1px solid var(--border-hi); border-radius: 14px; overflow-x: auto; background: var(--surface); }
  .ld-table table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: .95rem; }
  .ld-table th, .ld-table td { padding: 14px 20px; text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .ld-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 0; }
  .ld-table th { color: #fff; font-weight: 600; background: var(--surface-2); }
  .ld-table td:first-child { color: var(--muted); }
  .ld-table .y { color: var(--green); font-weight: 600; }
  .ld-table .n { color: var(--amber); }
  .ld-steps { list-style: none; counter-reset: s; padding: 0; margin: 32px 0 24px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }
  .ld-steps li { counter-increment: s; position: relative; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px; padding: 54px 20px 20px; background: var(--surface); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
  .ld-steps li::before { content: counter(s); position: absolute; top: 16px; left: 20px; width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent-2); color: #fff; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; display: grid; place-items: center; }
  .ld-steps b { color: #fff; }
  .ld-steps span { color: var(--muted); font-size: .92rem; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .ld-code { margin: 0; padding: 20px 24px; overflow-x: auto; border: 1px solid var(--border-hi); border-radius: 14px; background: var(--code-bg); font: 13.5px/1.7 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; }
  .ld-code .c { color: var(--muted); }
  .ld-end { margin-top: 96px; padding: 56px 24px; text-align: center; border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, transparent); border-radius: 20px; background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%, rgba(139,124,248,.18), transparent 70%), var(--surface); }
  .ld-end p { max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto; color: var(--muted); }
  .ld-support { margin-top: 28px !important; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .ld-coffee { display: inline-block; margin-top: 14px; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--amber) 16%, transparent); color: var(--amber); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--amber) 45%, transparent); box-shadow: none; }
  .ld-coffee:hover { box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(245,158,11,.35); }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .ld-flow { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; } .ld-pod { margin: -1px 0 0; } .ld-hero { padding-top: 32px; } }
</style>
